window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>This beautiful stowaway might be able to tame Eren's out-of-control, broken bear—unless the danger she's running from destroys both of them.</b></p> <p>Eren is hiding a lot of secrets from his loving, rambunctious family of polar bear shifters... especially the truth of what happened to him and his bear during the years he was gone from Westerly Cove, and where exactly he goes on his secret supply runs to a hidden island.</p> <p>The last thing he needs is a gorgeous stowaway turning up on his fishing boat. Even if she's his fated mate... and he's gone the minute he looks into her eyes.</p> <p>Rich girl Lucy has never had to live on her own before, but now she's on the run, forced to take refuge in Eren's fishing boat. For someone who's used to mansions and fancy restaurants, just doing the dishes is a brand new experience, let alone living in the confines of a fishing boat with a scorching hot fisherman who makes her stomach do flips every time she brushes past him.</p> <p>And that's even before she has to deal with his family...</p> <p>But even if the clash between pampered rich girl and hard-working fishing-boat owner won't torpedo this relationship before it begins, there's danger on Lucy's heels—and it just might threaten everything they both hold dear.</p> <p><i>Return to the magical small town of Westerly Cove and the Nilsson family in the second book in the Westerly Cove series, with love, laughs, heat, and a guaranteed HEA.</i></p>"; 
